{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52199","headline":"颂六十二首 二十四 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"封迷昏闇久，徘徊梦里藏。\n心尘既未洗，怖沾甘露浆。\n慈颜发晖曜，烛我见朝阳。\n忽逢善知友，开导益神光。\n稍悟心澄静，方猒俗苍茫。\n缁徒既肃肃，法侣亦锵锵。\n见者心欢喜，归诚向道场。\n若存信邪倒，来苦未何殃。\n（见同书卷二九《大乘部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}